{"id": "stanford-hotel-program-monitoring", "title": "San Francisco missed performance measures at a veterans’ housing program", "seconds": 40.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "2c9719c8392fbe96", "words": 133, "beats": [{"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "At the Stanford Hotel, the City left out its own performance targets.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.46, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "review", "text": "CARBON reporting system", "mark": "CARBON"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.22, 0.63, 1.15, 1.31, 1.58, 1.79, 1.93, 2.06, 2.23, 2.69]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The City left the property management targets out of its reporting system.", "t0": 3.58, "t1": 6.63, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "review", "text": "not set up by HSH in CARBON", "mark": "not set up"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.37, 0.54, 0.64, 1.05, 1.45, 1.84, 1.97, 2.05, 2.19, 2.62]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The separate support services agreement missed targets in some months.", "t0": 6.75, "t1": 10.11, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "review", "text": "support services agreement", "mark": "support services"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.53, 0.92, 1.39, 1.83, 2.07, 2.56, 2.69, 2.92]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The review documented 18 findings across the programs.", "t0": 10.23, "t1": 13.07, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "18", "label": "Program findings"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.43, 0.99, 1.42, 1.81, 2.09, 2.18]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The City paid three agreements for the site that fiscal year.", "t0": 13.29, "t1": 15.66, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "vouchers", "text": "Vendor Payments", "mark": "Payments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.36, 0.56, 0.76, 1.13, 1.24, 1.33, 1.57, 1.74, 2.09]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Together, they recorded $1,252,988.14 in payments.", "t0": 15.78, "t1": 18.86, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,252,988.14", "label": "Fiscal 2023–24 site payments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.58, 0.98, 1.21, 1.36, 1.45, 1.54, 1.84, 2.12, 2.43, 2.53]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The next year’s support services review still found items needing attention.", "t0": 19.08, "t1": 22.68, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "oct", "text": "areas that required attention", "mark": "attention"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.35, 0.59, 0.99, 1.44, 1.94, 2.24, 2.49, 2.82, 3.08]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In February 2026, Swords submitted a corrective plan.", "t0": 22.8, "t1": 26.16, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "oct", "text": "February 25, 2026", "mark": "February"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.62, 0.89, 1.84, 2.19, 2.55, 2.61, 2.99]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The City approved the plan. Its next visit would check the results.", "t0": 26.28, "t1": 29.18, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "oct", "text": "next scheduled Program Monitoring Site Visit", "mark": "Site Visit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.33, 0.61, 0.7, 1.15, 1.35, 1.57, 1.89, 2.05, 2.25, 2.35]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "A separate fiscal review had previously found no issues.", "t0": 29.3, "t1": 31.84, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "review", "text": "identified no findings", "mark": "no findings"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.47, 0.81, 1.12, 1.24, 1.65, 1.86, 2.01]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "By October, the fiscal review listed three unresolved issues.", "t0": 31.96, "t1": 34.98, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["fiscal 2023–24", "no findings"], "b": ["fiscal 2025–26", "three issues"], "kicker": "financial review"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.59, 0.7, 1.05, 1.34, 1.68, 2.04, 2.54]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "One was less than 30 days of operating cash.", "t0": 35.1, "t1": 37.55, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "30", "label": "Days of operating cash"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.5, 0.76, 0.92, 1.2, 1.44, 1.56, 1.97]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 37.67, "t1": 39.82, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"a": "The missing measures", "b": "Payments for the site", "c": "What the follow-up found"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "document"}